feat(electron): migrate java.util.prefs settings into a JSON store

Legacy settings live in java.util.prefs, whose backing store is platform-specific.
Add @aps/settings with:
- parser for the Linux ~/.java/.userPrefs prefs.xml node tree (with ancestor inheritance)
- parser for the XML plist of ~/Library/Preferences/com.apple.java.util.prefs.plist
- parser for reg query output under HKCU\Software\JavaSoft\Prefs
- migration of application.*, simpleperf.*, and layout-inspector view/canvas/archive keys
- a JSON settings store for the Electron application data directory

12 new unit tests (90 total); typecheck and lint are clean.
